     2621   DEFINE VARIABLE sym14 AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO FORMAT "x(1)":U INITIAL ":":U.
     2622   DEFINE VARIABLE sym15 AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO FORMAT "x(1)":U INITIAL ":":U.
