     2631   DEFINE VARIABLE v-quantity2 AS DECIMAL   NO-UNDO FORMAT ">>,>>9.999":U.
     2632   DEFINE VARIABLE cost-rubl   AS DECIMAL   NO-UNDO FORMAT ">>>,>>9.99":U.
